# Text boxes: typing, Markdown formatting, editing, moving, saving, export.
size 1280 800
click-item tab_insert
click-item insertText
click 480,240
type Limits of sequences
key Return
type - first item
key Return
type second item
key Ctrl+Home
click-item formatH1
click-item formatDone
expect-in-file My Notebook/First page.svg | <h1>Limits of sequences</h1>
expect-in-file My Notebook/First page.svg | dx:text="# Limits of sequences
expect-in-file My Notebook/First page.svg | <li>second item</li>
click 600,276
key End
type  Fast.
key Escape
expect-in-file My Notebook/First page.svg | Fast.
click-item tab_draw
click-item toolLasso
click 520,250
expect-prop canvas selectionCount 1
key Escape
export-pdf text.pdf
expect-pdf-text text.pdf | Limits of
expect-pdf-text text.pdf | second item
# Underline, color and size, which Markdown lacks, are kept too.
click-item tab_insert
click-item insertText
click 480,520
type Watch out: special *chars* stay
key Ctrl+A
click-item formatUnderline
click-item formatColor
click-item textColor1
click-item formatSize
click-item formatSize2
shot formatted
click-item formatDone
expect-in-file My Notebook/First page.svg | <span style="color:#d12f2f;font-size:1.375em"><u>Watch out: special *chars* stay</u></span>
# Opening the box again keeps the formatting.
click 520,530
key End
type !
key Escape
expect-in-file My Notebook/First page.svg | <u>Watch out: special *chars* stay!</u>
